 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? Find dry spot under few layers of clothes and get some sleep. Thunder doesn't hurt camps until it rains heavily. Sure, bag first, then tent. Tent can be lightest just rolled up and bag still with it. Keep an eye on the thunder, if it gets closer or several run together we turn back before it rains. Otherwise wait it out here. Got it. Get the tent up and fully dried out. Then pack the tent and bag. Get inside before it pours.",
